        "TileImage": "$($repository fd5e4b5f-ade1-4323-8622-823b48685b9f).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets (HVTs) at the Himmipan Hotel in Bangkok, Thailand. Below are the listed targets and the preferred kill methods. \r\rJackie Carrington: Eliminate with electrocution.\rAbel De Silva: Eliminate by drowning.\rMrs. Mookjai: Eliminate with injected lethal poison.\rDexy Barat: Eliminate with Fibre wire.\rHeidi Santoro: Eliminate by snapping her neck.\r\rDiscression is of utmost importance when eliminating these HVTs.\r\rGood Luck!\rReapingZ",
